// Older names of textures, for resource packs made for older versions and
// for Kenzo's v1.0 textures (assets/textures/, laid out like a 1.12 pack).
// Textures are looked up by their modern 1.21 location (block/oak_planks,
// item/bow, entity/pig/temperate_pig); each pack is searched for the modern
// name, then these, before falling back to the pack below it. Besides this
// table, block/X also tries blocks/X and item/X also tries items/X, the
// folder names before 1.13.
